6.8 Referential Integrity
The database enforces the following referential integrity constraints:

Every file.work_id must exist in work.

Every stag_annotation.work_id must exist in work.

Every null_model_result.work_id must exist in work.

Every provenance.work_id must exist in work.

Every moderation.work_id must exist in work.

The version chain (supersedes and superseded_by) must be acyclic.

