Data flow:

API requests go to the REST or GraphQL API. The API calls the deposit loader, writer, reader, updater, deleter, query engine, search engine, aggregation engine, exporter, or importer. The database schema stores the data. The audit logging records every operation. The authentication and authorization check access. The moderation workflow handles moderation. The citation generator produces citations. The backup and restore handle backup. The web interface provides depositing, browsing, and querying.

