Validation Engine Design
The library validates the following:

Validation 1. Deposit validity. Every deposit is validated against the deposit schema before it is stored.

Validation 2. STAG annotation validity. Every STAG annotation is validated against the STAG schema and the thirty-two semantic rules.

Validation 3. Null-Model Protocol result validity. Every Null-Model Protocol result is validated against the Null-Model Protocol schema.

Validation 4. Referential integrity. Every foreign key reference must resolve to an existing record.

Validation 5. Version chain acyclicity. The version chain (supersedes and superseded_by) must be acyclic.

Validation 6. Provenance completeness. Every deposit must have a provenance record.

Validation 7. Audit completeness. Every operation must have an audit log entry.

Validation 8. Moderation completeness. Every deposit must have a moderation record.

Validation 9. File hash integrity. Every file's hash must match the stored hash.

